.TH IP-AUDIT-REPORT 1 "November 2026" "Kea IP Audit Hook" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ip-audit-report \- report aggregate DHCP audit activity
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ip-audit-report
[
.B --bucket
.I hourly|daily
]
[
.B --from
.I TIMESTAMP
.B --to
.I TIMESTAMP
]
.I LOGS
[
.I LOGS
...]
[
.B --json
|
.B --table
]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ip-audit-report
groups valid event records by UTC time bucket, POP, site, event, and address family. The
default bucket is daily; hourly buckets are available. An optional half-open time range
filters events before aggregation.
.PP
A base log path includes that file and numbered rotations, including gzip rotations.
Explicit files and quoted shell glob patterns are also accepted. Input is streamed; only
aggregate groups are retained in memory.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --bucket " hourly|daily"
Select UTC bucket size. The default is daily.
.TP
.BI --from " TIMESTAMP"
Inclusive timezone-aware ISO 8601 start. Must be used with
.BR --to .
.TP
.BI --to " TIMESTAMP"
Exclusive timezone-aware ISO 8601 end, later than
.BR --from .
.TP
.B -h, --help
Show the help message and exit.
.TP
.B --json
Write bucket metadata, filters, totals, and aggregate rows as JSON.
.TP
.B --table
Write tab-separated aggregate rows with a header.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I LOGS
One or more log files, base log paths, or quoted glob patterns. A base path includes that
file and its numbered or gzip-compressed rotations.
.SH OUTPUT
Readable text is the default. Aggregate columns are bucket start/end, POP, site, event,
address family, and count. Missing dimensions are grouped as (missing). Output deliberately
omits IP addresses, client identifiers, hardware addresses, DUIDs, and relay identifiers.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The report was produced, including when there are no matching records.
.TP
.B 2
Invalid arguments, malformed input, invalid timestamps, or unreadable logs.
.SH PRIVACY AND LIMITATIONS
The report contains aggregate counts only, but POP and site labels may still be sensitive
operational data. Protect output according to local policy. Aggregates describe available log
records and cannot prove completeness if events were dropped, filtered, or never written.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
ip-audit-report /var/log/kea/ip-audit.log /var/log/kea/ip-audit6.log
ip-audit-report --bucket hourly --from 2026-11-01T00:00:00Z \\
  --to 2026-11-02T00:00:00Z --json /var/log/kea/ip-audit.log
ip-audit-report --table /var/log/kea/ip-audit.log
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ip-audit-check (1),
.BR ip-audit-lookup (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Kea IP Audit Hook contributors.
